**What was duplicated:** `@Query`, `@QueryName`, `@Header`, and `@Field` each had an identical ~20-line block that (1) checked whether the parameter type is `Iterable` or array, (2) resolved the element type accordingly, (3) obtained a `Converter<?, String>`, and (4) wrapped the base handler with `.iterable()` or `.array()`.

